ere  MDF which was a high density fiber like  cardboard cut but Steve says watching  his masterpieces get destroyed is all  just part of the job it's kind of  run-of-the-mill for the miniature side  of things most of the time when you're  building a miniature it's for the  purpose of it being blown up or smashed  or destroyed in some some respect it's  it's actually the thing you kind of look  forward to  [Music]  you  [Music]
 

